      "sha256": "543972fabf4f21bbf13e4506f58061734dd52079320d7118ed638f4074e07d1a",
      "text": "Oh, thank goodness, there's my badge. Hang on, why does it say HOST? I thought I'd signed up to help, you know, carry a box, point at a door, quietly disappear when somebody mentions a microphone. Apparently I ticked the enthusiastic box. There's an enthusiastic box? Four, please. We need the noticeboard.",
