    {
      "id": "r8_6_0",
      "author": "nemi",
      "file": "res://episodes/episode_001/audio/source/r8_6_0_88e00209a069.wav",
      "sha256": "0104f5e2a167388f8de58297f9aff9bd0d4b962a4511881c3a1a59a592a21541",
      "text": "That's the microphone. I can explain an entire anime power system to somebody who didn't ask, but apparently good morning requires rehearsing until my personality leaves my body. Before I get up there, could you check who's watching? Seven opens the last choice. I'm going to practise looking like this was my idea.",
