    },
    {
      "id": "r8_9_0",
      "author": "nemi",
      "file": "res://episodes/episode_001/audio/source/r8_9_0_cc3b09c13bb1.wav",
      "sha256": "6c463e431005bb6169506e991c95cd57105431b4e25a685ae3eee3b536352e22",
      "text": "Good morning, everyone, and welcome to whatever this is. Right, nobody fainted. The duck looks exactly as disappointed as before, so I'm calling that progress. Thank you for staying with me. And the pudding was last Friday. Of course it was. Zero if you'd like to try talking me out of this next time.",
